*.heapprofile

# Local agent state. AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md at the root are tracked: they say how to work here.
MEMORY.md
memory.md
.codex/
.claude/

# Python leaves these beside the Blender and map scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# What a save leaves beside itself, and certificates
*.db.lock
.rescue-t*
.pre-v*
.replaced-*
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx

